      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    \n    <!-- Title -->\n    <h1>Discovering Video Game Development</h1>\n    \n    <!-- informational paragraph -->\n    <p>Ever wondered how video games are made? Behind every game is a team of creative minds working together, from the first sketch to the final level. Video game development combines art, storytelling, programming, and sound design to create immersive worlds for players to explore.</p> \n    \n    <!-- images -->\n    <div class=\"container1\">\n      <img src=\"world-design.png\" alt=\"world design\">\n      <img src=\"character-design.png\" alt=\"character design\">\n      <img src=\"enemy-design.png\" alt=\"enemy design\">\n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- info -->\n    <p>Video games start as ideas that grow into stories and worlds, thanks to the talent of designers, artists, and programmers. Every character, quest, and puzzle is carefully crafted to bring joy and challenge to gamers worldwide.</p>\n    \n    <!-- images -->\n    <div class=\"container2\">\n      <img src=\"code.png\" alt=\"game code\">\n      <p>It's a journey from concept to coding, with artists bringing characters to life and programmers solving complex problems to make the game run smoothly.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <h2>Learn More:</h2>\n    <p>Curious about how to get started in game development? <a href=\"https://code.org/educate/gamelab\">Explore more about creating your own game with Code.org</a>.</p>\n    \n    <!-- image citation -->\n    <div class=\"citation\">\n      <p>All images created by chatGPT</p>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* 1) ADD A RULE SET FOR EACH PSEUDO-CLASS TO STYLE THE ANCHOR TAG */\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n/* body style */\nbody {\n  background-color: #f3eff6;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-family: Arial;\n}\n\n/* title style */\nh1 {\n  font-family: Arial;\n  font-size: 36px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: 24px;\n}\n\n/* paragraph style */\np {\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n/* image flex layout style */\n.container1 {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  justify-content: space-around;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n/* image flex layout style */\n.container2 {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n/* image style */\nimg {\n  border-style: solid;\n  border-radius: 15px;\n  width: 350px;\n  margin: 15px;\n}\n\n/* citation style */\n.citation {\n  height: 300px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n}\n\n.citation > p {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-style: italic;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
